<title>QATAR: SOCCER-INDIA AND SRI LANKA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INDIA AND SRI LANKA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India and Sri Lanka drew 1-1 in their World Cup soccer Asian zone group 10 qualifying match on Tuesday in Qatar.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka - Anton Silva (14th minute)</p>
<p>India - Carlton Chapman (39th minute)</p>
</text>
